---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const HERO_IMAGE = "/Gemini_Generated_Image_aw8b9saw8b9saw8b.png";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Bluu3 - Votre piscine, toujours sous contrôle"
  description="SaaS piscine pour mesures, interventions, Eco-Score MVP, Pool Passport et suivi propriétaire."
  themeColor="#020617"
  bodyClass="bg-slate-950 text-white antialiased"
>
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-white/10 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10"></div>
          <div class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight">Bluu3</div>
          <span class="ml-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-2 py-1 text-xs text-white/80">
            MVP SaaS piscine
          </span>
        </div>

        <nav class="hidden items-center gap-6 text-sm text-white/80 md:flex">
          <a class="hover:text-white" href="#product">Produit</a>
          <a class="hover:text-white" href="#passport">Pool Passport</a>
          <a class="hover:text-white" href="#eco-score">Eco-Score</a>
          <a class="hover:text-white" href="/app">Dashboard</a>
        </nav>

        <a
          href="/app/logs/new"
          class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/90 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-400"
        >
          Tester l'app
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center"
        style={`background-image:url('${HERO_IMAGE}')`}
      ></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-slate-950/70 to-slate-950/20"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/35"></div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-white/90">
            <span>SaaS + IoT + IA</span>
            <span class="opacity-70">-</span>
            <span>USA</span>
            <span class="opacity-70">-</span>
            <span>Canada</span>
            <span class="opacity-70">-</span>
            <span>France</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="font-display mt-6 text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-7xl">
            Bluu3 — votre piscine, toujours sous contrôle.
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80 md:text-xl">
            Mesures d'eau, interventions, alertes, Eco-Score MVP et Pool Passport pour piscinistes,
            propriétaires et premiers pilotes.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a
              href="#demo"
              class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-white/90"
            >
              Demander une démo
            </a>
            <a
              href="/app"
              class="rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10"
            >
              Voir le produit
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-4">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Mesures</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/70">pH, chlore, température, ORP.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-4">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Interventions</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/70">Planning, statuts, rapports.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-4">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Passeport piscine</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/70">Historique et export PDF.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-white/60">
            Bluu3 aide au pilotage et à la documentation. L'Eco-Score MVP est un indicateur interne,
            pas une certification finale.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="product" class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-16 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Un MVP utilisable pour les piscinistes et leurs clients.</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-white/70">
            Démarrer avec des données réelles, une base PostgreSQL, des rôles simples et des rapports
            exploitables. Les capteurs et l'IA avancée pourront arriver ensuite.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/80">
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Dashboard pisciniste B2B alimenté par PostgreSQL</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Espace propriétaire B2C simple et responsive</li>
            <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Exports PDF pour suivi mensuel et interventions</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-6">
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-white/90">Aperçu MVP</div>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/40 p-4">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Villa - Miami</div>
              <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-white/75">
                <span>Qualité eau</span><span class="text-amber-300">Attention</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-white/75">
                <span>Eco-Score MVP</span><span class="text-amber-300">C</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-white/60">Dernière mesure : aujourd'hui 09:12</div>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/40 p-4">
              <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Boutique Hotel - Nice</div>
              <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-white/75">
                <span>Qualité eau</span><span class="text-emerald-300">OK</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between text-sm text-white/75">
                <span>Pool Passport</span><span class="text-emerald-300">Prêt</span>
              </div>
              <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-white/60">Rapport mensuel : prêt</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="eco-score" class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Eco-Score MVP</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-white/70">Un score 0-100 avec grade A à E pour visualiser l'eau, l'énergie, la chimie, les déplacements et le CO2. Cette version est un indicateur MVP, pas une certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="passport" class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Pool Passport MVP</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-6">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Identité</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Piscine, propriétaire, pisciniste et équipements.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-6">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Historique</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">Mesures, interventions et statut de santé.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 p-6">
            <div class="text-sm font-semibold">Export</div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-white/70">QR code placeholder et PDF simple pour les pilotes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-white/15 bg-gradient-to-r from-white/5 to-white/0 p-8 md:p-10">
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Déploiement MVP pour pilotes</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-white/70">Railway pour l'API Node, PostgreSQL, staging, production MVP et variables d'environnement.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row" id="demo">
            <a
              href="#"
              class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/90 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 hover:bg-emerald-400"
            >
              Demander une démo
            </a>
            <a
              href="#"
              class="rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10"
            >
              Accéder au dashboard
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="border-t border-white/10 py-10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 text-sm text-white/60">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Bluu3. Tous droits réservés.
      </div>
    </footer>
</BaseLayout>
